# Left over on disk from the pre-cleanup branches (sim-integration and older):
# the Mosaic3D/UniDet3D submodule checkouts and the SpUNet feature cache. Not
# used by the patrol pipeline; kept only so switching back to those branches
# doesn't require re-cloning. Safe to delete.
Mosaic3D/
unidet3d/
3D-segmentation/
playground/

